+// Cl14: with the ForceGoogleSafeSearch policy on, Google's throttle alone
+// changes a Google search page's address (two changes at the start stop a
+// DCHECK build), and a redirect page into a search opens it cleaned and with
+// SafeSearch on. Google's pages are served here by an interceptor; nothing
